{
  "$description": "Engage overrides the contract's semantic and component tokens (#125). It leaves alone the tokens that Appearance and console mode change through override sets. Glow strength 0 keeps focus a crisp teal edge without glow. Text and status colours meet WCAG AA (4.5:1) on every surface, border.strong 3:1, and white on the accent 5:1.",
